                                "text": "sclerotic bureaucracy"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "323e87c1-db63-41e1-bd08-8dfdffa08157",
                                "sense_id": "82b6c1f8-653e-30c2-895b-eea52d570542",
                                "text": "Most state parties--Democrat or Republican--are sclerotic and dutiful, and little help to local candidates."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "177f6cb0-4153-429b-a631-bea6606ff35a",
                                "sense_id": "82b6c1f8-653e-30c2-895b-eea52d570542",
                                "text": "His funeral ends the era of first generation leaders in post-colonial Asia, in fact in the world, with the exception of a few sclerotic kleptocrats mostly in Africa."
