                                "sense_id": "3dbc36fa-e7f2-30ec-9520-0c41b69b0848",
                                "text": "In front, this membrane is continuous with the cornea by direct continuity of tissue; but the opaque sclerotic overlaps it rather more on the outer than upon its inner surface."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1ae3ede-5f18-4f34-8be0-6bccc1195f40",
                                "sense_id": "3dbc36fa-e7f2-30ec-9520-0c41b69b0848",
                                "text": "An icteric discoloration of the sclerotic — a quite common symptom in xanthopia from arsenical poisoning — is very seldom observed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
